# Izek Strazni travelling with the party (docs/voice/izek.md): short lines a guest says while walking with the party, shown and voiced
# like banter (story/banter.gd). The node's name says when it may play: place_ on entering an area, fight_ after a won fight, idle_ now
# and then on the road. Each plays once per playthrough, only while Izek is with the party. Story Allies Presence Plan, package Z2;
# drafted by Gemini (docs/plans/gemini_allies/z2/), edited; every line here is unvoiced for now.

~ place_vallaki
if guest:izek and region:vallaki
interject guest:izek: Keep walking past the square. That fat fool can hang his own lanterns.
endif
-> END

~ place_village
if guest:izek and at:village_of_barovia
interject guest:izek: That is the churchyard where Kolyan lies. He kept her safe when I could not.
endif
-> END

~ place_lake
if guest:izek and at:lake_zarovich_trail
interject guest:izek: Keep to the trees above Lake Zarovich. I have no use for that water.
endif
-> END

~ place_castle
if guest:izek and region:castle_ravenloft
interject guest:izek: The rider's house is cold. Stay behind my right shoulder.
endif
-> END

~ fight_arm
if guest:izek
interject guest:izek: Don't look at the arm. The fire goes down when the work is done.
endif
-> END

~ fight_ireena
if guest:izek and guest:ireena
interject guest:izek: Leave the blood on my coat. Is she all right? Look at her first.
endif
-> END

~ idle_doll
if guest:izek and not flag.izek_sister_1
interject guest:izek: Blinsky used good wood for the face. I keep one in my coat so the rain doesn't spoil it.
endif
-> END

~ idle_wait
if guest:izek
interject guest:izek: Nine years old to now is a long sit by a door. Another mile is nothing.
endif
-> END

~ idle_dark
if guest:izek
interject guest:izek: Too quiet in these pines. Something is listening back.
endif
-> END
